    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean \"unburdened\"? it just feels like the only way for them to be happy is if i wasn't even a part of their lives anymore. like, if i wasn't there to mess things up, they could actually breathe again. it feels like the most decent thing i could do is just... stop being a problem for them.",
